      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِعْشَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُعَاشٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also (tropical:)  <i>Haste,</i>
or <i>quickness.</i> (A, TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ رِعْشَةٌ إِلَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِقَآءِ عَدُوِّهِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>In him is haste,</i> or <i>quickness, to meet
his enemy.</i> (A.)

